00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:37.700
♪ If you want to try and
put an end to this depraved world ♪

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.250
♪ Have pride ♪

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.620
♪ ...and rise up ♪

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.620
